# The indexer already skips whatever .gitignore ignores (docs/token-usage.md,
# 2026-10-08), so a line here is only for a path git tracks or leaves
# untracked: stray binaries outside bin/, the rest of .claude/cache/, and an
# untracked staging/.
**/*.dll
**/*.pdb
.claude/cache/
staging/

# Closed records: never edited to match the code (CLAUDE.md), so a hit there is
# history rather than the answer; grep them instead.
docs/superpowers/
docs/pr-decision-log.md
docs/lessons.md

# Generated EF Core migrations crowd out the code a question is about
# (docs/token-usage.md, 2026-10-08); the filenames and `git log` are how a
# schema change is found instead.
**/*.Designer.cs
**/Migrations/
